      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I am LIVE on @MadDogRadio and I\u2019m not here for the casual takes today! Don\u2019t play it safe! \n\n\ud83d\udcfb sxm.app.link/MadDogRadio",
